flowchart TB
    USER[👥 User]
    API[🌐 Flask API]
    QUEUE[📋 Redis Queue]
    RESULTS[💾 Redis Results]
    WORKER[⚙️ Celery Workers]
    KEDA[📊 KEDA Autoscaler]
    EXT[🌤️ Weather API]

    USER -->|POST /weather| API
    API -->|Add task| QUEUE
    API -->|Return task_id| USER
    
    QUEUE -->|Pull task| WORKER
    WORKER -->|Call API| EXT
    EXT -->|Weather data| WORKER
    WORKER -->|Save result| RESULTS
    
    USER -->|GET /result| API
    API -->|Query result| RESULTS
    RESULTS -->|Result data| API
    API -->|Send weather| USER
    
    QUEUE -.->|Monitor| KEDA
    KEDA -.->|Scale| WORKER

    style USER fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#6a1b9a,stroke-width:3px
    style API fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b,stroke-width:3px
    style QUEUE fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:3px
    style RESULTS fill:#ffebee,stroke:#c62828,stroke-width:3px
    style WORKER fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f57f17,stroke-width:3px
    style KEDA fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:3px
    style EXT fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#880e4f,stroke-width:3px